fixup! Wave 1, place: Back returns to the same spot; typing and open sections are kept

A form left open with typing is open again on Back, Forward and Reload: the shell taps its opener for the person
(no step on Back), and the box the shell takes away lets go of the cursor quietly so its change is not new typing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FKTjPFbzEx2ZvP4BhqKEiS
